SUMMARY:Brijean DJ Set supported by Colloboh
LOCATION:Camille's at The Bellwether\, Westlake
DESCRIPTION:21+ OnlyJoin us at Camille's at The Bellwether for a DJ Set fro
 
m Brijean! Brijean Bio: Since their debut as Brijean\, the project of percu
 
ssionist/singer-songwriter Brijean Murphy (the percussive heartbeat for liv
 
e bands like Mitski\, Poolside\, and Toro y Moi) and multi-instrumentalist/
 
producer Doug Stuart has moved with ingenuity\, fusing psych-pop abstractio
 
n with dancefloor sensibilities. Brijean engages different sides of themsel
 
ves\, the paradox of being alive. Murphy's layered percussion and expressiv
 
e vocals coupled with Stuart's production and harmonic palette evoked shade
 
s of disco\, '90s house\, and a sly pop sensibility. "A smooth\, sumptuous\
 
, and soulful record\," said Bandcamp\, who helped propel the group's early
 
 following. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/brijean-collobo
 
h-camilles-at-the-bellwether-tickets/15000653
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/brijean-colloboh-camilles-at-the-bellwe
 
ther-tickets/15000653
END:VEVENT
